  "step_3": "The decision reason requires considering the maximum magnitude outcome and weighting it by its probability. The individual in the report recognizes that the maximum outcome in A (4000€) is higher than in B (3000€), which is relevant. However, the individual does not mention or apply the probability weighting (i.e., 4000×0.20 vs. 3000×0.25), nor does the reasoning involve a comparison of the weighted values. The justification is based solely on the magnitude of the win, not on a weighted evaluation of the maximum outcome. Therefore, while the individual identifies a key feature of the decision reason (the higher maximum outcome), they fail to use the full rule — which includes weighting by probability. Thus, the decision reason was not fully or correctly used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 30
